      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Z.ai Releases GLM-5.2: A Leading Open-Weights Text LLM",
          "zh": "Z.ai 发布 GLM-5.2：领先的开放权重文本大型语言模型"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Chinese AI lab Z.ai released its GLM-5.2 large language model with full open weights under an MIT license on June 16th.",
          "zh": "中国人工智能实验室 Z.ai 于 6 月 16 日发布了 GLM-5.2 大型语言模型，其开放权重采用 MIT 许可。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "GLM-5.2 was released with full open weights under an MIT license on June 16th, following an initial subscriber release.",
            "The model is a 753B parameter LLM, requiring 1.51TB of storage, and incorporates 40 active parameters within a Mixture of Experts architecture.",
            "It is a text-input-only model and has been identified as the leading open-weights model on Artificial Analysis."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "GLM-5.2 于 6 月 16 日发布，其完整开放权重采用 MIT 许可，此前已面向编程计划订阅者发布。",
            "该模型是一个拥有 7530 亿参数的大型语言模型，需要 1.51TB 存储空间，并包含 40 个活跃参数的专家混合 (Mixture of Experts) 架构。",
            "它是一个仅限文本输入的模型，并已被确认为 Artificial Analysis 上领先的开放权重模型。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The availability of a powerful, open-weights text-only LLM under an MIT license provides a significant resource to the AI industry. This release has the potential to accelerate research and development within the open-source community.",
          "zh": "以 MIT 许可提供强大的、仅限文本的开放权重大型语言模型，为人工智能行业提供了重要资源。此次发布有潜力加速开源社区内的研究与开发。"
        },
        "source": "Simon Willison",
        "link": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jun/17/glm-52/#atom-everything"
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "en": "Grid Demands and Local Impacts Shape Data Center Deployment",
          "zh": "电网需求与局部影响塑造数据中心部署"
