        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Rapid data center deployment faces challenges related to power grid flexibility and potential outsized local resource impacts.",
          "zh": "数据中心的快速部署面临电网灵活性以及潜在的超乎寻常的局部资源影响等挑战。"
