        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "The collective activation of millions of electric kettles caused a significant power surge, illustrating grid flexibility challenges.",
            "Even moderately sized data centers can exert an outsized local impact on resources or infrastructure.",
            "Ensuring grid flexibility is critical for expediting the deployment of new data centers."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "数百万英国人集体使用电热水壶导致显著的电力激增，凸显了电网灵活性的挑战。",
            "即使是中等规模的数据中心，也可能对当地资源或基础设施产生超乎寻常的局部影响。",
            "确保电网灵活性对于加快新数据中心的部署至关重要。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The rapid expansion of AI infrastructure necessitates robust power grid solutions and careful consideration of local resource strains for sustainable deployment.",
          "zh": "人工智能基础设施的快速扩展，要求电网具备强大的解决方案，并需审慎考虑当地资源压力，以实现可持续部署。"
        },
